# 镜像构建上下文只保留运行所需源码，缓存、证据与本地产物一律不进入构建上下文。
.git
node_modules/
apps/*/node_modules/
apps/*/build/
apps/*/.svelte-kit/
.local/
.env
.env.*
coverage/
dist/
build/
tmp/
test-results/
playwright-report/
.agent-sources/
.worktrees/
doc-driven-ai/
*.bak
*.tmp
*.orig
.codegraph/
.serena/
.codex/
.antigravitycli/
tests/evidence/
tests
docs
config
ops/**
!ops/oci
!ops/oci/**
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets
**/secrets
# packages/secrets 是密钥管理的源码包，镜像构建依赖它；只排除运行时密钥材料目录。
!packages/secrets
!packages/secrets/**
# 源码包重新纳入后，其中的密钥材料后缀仍按最后匹配规则保持排除。
packages/secrets/**/*.pem
packages/secrets/**/*.key
packages/secrets/**/*.p12
packages/secrets/**/*.pfx
packages/secrets/**/.env
packages/secrets/**/.env.*
dependency-graph.html
ops/compose/meristem.prod.env
ops/compose/*.env
